# supabase CLI link-state (which project a command targets) - deliberately never committed, per
# the v2 tasks' standing convention of always passing --project-ref explicitly rather than
# relying on ambient linked-project state (see task-11-report.md for why this line was added).
supabase/.temp/
# standalone backup of pre-v4.1 frontend work, not part of the extension source
frontend-backup/
# v4.2 Task 1: the bare "frontend-backup/" pattern above (no leading slash) matches a directory
# named "frontend-backup" at ANY depth, not just the repo-root backup folder it was written for -
# it was silently also matching snufflestudy/src/sidepanel/styles/frontend-backup/, the real,
# intentionally-committed directory of ported CSS Modules the V4.2 Implementation Plan's File
# Structure section names explicitly. Re-included here rather than renaming that directory, since
# every later v4.2 task's brief refers to it by this exact path.
!/snufflestudy/src/sidepanel/styles/frontend-backup/
!/snufflestudy/src/sidepanel/styles/frontend-backup/**
